{"tool_name":"vfoldmcpx","contents":["oeb","bioschemas","biotools"],"fetched_metadata":{"biotools":{"id":"vfoldmcpx","home":"http://rna.physics.missouri.edu/vfoldMCPX2","summary":"Predicting 2D structures of Multi-strand RNA complexes","addition_date":"2022-06-08T13:22:36.007443Z","last_update_date":"2022-06-08T13:22:36.010097Z","tool_type":["Web application"],"accessibility":"Open access","biotools_curie":"biotools:vfoldmcpx","cost":"Free of charge","credit":[{"email":"chenshi@missouri.edu","name":"Yi Cheng","typeEntity":"Person"},{"name":"Peixuan Guo"},{"name":"Shi-Jie Chen"},{"name":"Sicheng Zhang","typeEntity":"Person"}],"edit_permission":{"type":"private"},"function":[{"input":[{"data":{"term":"RNA sequence","uri":"http://edamontology.org/data_3495"}}],"operation":[{"term":"Fold recognition","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_0303"},{"term":"RNA secondary structure prediction","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_0278"},{"term":"RNA structure prediction","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_2441"}]}],"name":"VfoldMCPX","operating_system":["Linux","Mac","Windows"],"owner":"Jennifer","publication":[{"doi":"10.1261/RNA.079020.121","metadata":{"abstract":"\u00a9 2022 Zhang et al.; Published by Cold Spring Harbor Laboratory Press for the RNA Society.Multistrand RNA complexes play a critical role in RNA-related biological processes. The understanding of RNA functions and the rational design of RNA nanostructures require accurate prediction of the structure and folding stability of the complexes, including those containing pseudoknots. Here, we present VfoldMCPX, a new model for predicting two-dimensional (2D) structures and folding stabilities of multistrand RNA complexes. Based on a partition function-based algorithm combined with physical loop free energy parameters, the VfoldMCPX model predicts not only the native structure but also the folding stability of the complex. An important advantage of the model is the ability to treat pseudoknotted structures. Extensive tests on structure predictions show the VfoldMCPX model provides improved accuracy for multistranded RNA complexes, especially for RNA complexes with three or more strands and/or containing pseudoknots. We have developed a freely accessible VfoldMCPX web server at http://rna.physics.missouri.edu/vfoldMCPX2.","authors":[{"name":"Chen S.-J."},{"name":"Cheng Y."},{"name":"Guo P."},{"name":"Zhang S."}],"date":"2022-04-01T00:00:00Z","journal":"RNA (New York, N.Y.)","title":"VfoldMCPX: predicting multistrand RNA complexes"},"pmcid":"PMC8925972","pmid":"35058350"}],"topic":[{"term":"Nucleic acid structure analysis","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_0097"},{"term":"Physics","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_3318"},{"term":"RNA","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_0099"},{"term":"Structure prediction","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_0082"}],"validated":1},"bioschemas":{"name":"VfoldMCPX","home":"https://bio.tools/vfoldmcpx","summary":"Predicting 2D structures of Multi-strand RNA complexes","tool_type":"sc:SoftwareApplication"},"oeb":{"metrics":[{"@id":"https://openebench.bsc.es/monitor/metrics/biotools:vfoldmcpx/web/rna.physics.missouri.edu","@license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/","@nmsp":"biotools","@type":"metrics","deprecated":true,"project":{"build":{},"deployment":{},"publications":[{"entries":[{"cit_count":8,"citations":[{"count":1,"year":"2022"},{"count":1,"year":"2023"},{"count":1,"year":"2026"},{"count":2,"year":"2025"},{"count":3,"year":"2024"}],"doi":"10.1261/rna.079020.121","pmcid":"PMC8925972","pmid":"35058350","ref_count":59,"refs":[{"count":1,"year":"1995"},{"count":1,"year":"1998"},{"count":1,"year":"2000"},{"count":1,"year":"2003"},{"count":1,"year":"2012"},{"count":1,"year":"2013"},{"count":1,"year":"2019"},{"count":2,"year":"2005"},{"count":2,"year":"2007"},{"count":2,"year":"2018"},{"count":2,"year":"2021"},{"count":3,"year":"2006"},{"count":3,"year":"2008"},{"count":3,"year":"2009"},{"count":3,"year":"2010"},{